1113
00:58:01,792 --> 00:58:03,375
Life is so exhausting,

1114
00:58:04,417 --> 00:58:07,083
we see so many hard things
happening to us

1115
00:58:07,167 --> 00:58:10,500
and to the people around us,
and to the world in general,

1116
00:58:11,167 --> 00:58:14,042
that if you don't have a sense of humor
or are unable to smile,

1117
00:58:15,792 --> 00:58:19,500
you feel like going
to another planet

1118
00:58:20,167 --> 00:58:22,667
or leaving, in general, I don't know.

1119
00:58:23,292 --> 00:58:26,583
I think everything has a comedic side.  That's why he

1120
00:58:27,750 --> 00:58:31,125
said that great tragedy
always has something of comedy,

1121
00:58:32,167 --> 00:58:34,958
and comedies
always have something tragic.

1122
00:58:35,792 --> 00:58:37,792
For me, humor is fundamental.

1123
00:58:38,333 --> 00:58:40,250
I see everything with a sense of humor.

1124
00:58:40,667 --> 00:58:44,417
And that also relaxes me quite a bit,
because also...

1125
00:58:44,500 --> 00:58:48,792
My friends call me
"Intensa" Portillo, a nickname

1126
00:58:48,875 --> 00:58:50,958
that sometimes I don't know if it's very good.  I

1127
