experience everything with great intensity.
The good things, too.

1128
00:58:54,417 --> 00:58:57,542
That good thing is fantastic!
That evil is terrible!

1129
00:58:57,625 --> 00:59:00,292
And this... I like it.  I

1130
00:59:00,375 --> 00:59:03,542
have a friend who says she
's not a "liker", that she's a "coret".

1131
00:59:04,417 --> 00:59:06,875
She's not a "like",
she's a "coret".

1132
00:59:06,958 --> 00:59:09,583
Well, that's how I am,
very passionate about things.

1133
00:59:09,667 --> 00:59:11,750
I think humor

1134
