is what makes me relativize,

1135
00:59:14,458 --> 00:59:17,333
because otherwise you would
n't take any steps forward.

1136
00:59:17,417 --> 00:59:20,750
There are things that leave you very down
and very dusty.

1137
00:59:21,708 --> 00:59:25,750
So, laughter is
what allows you to cleanse and sanitize.

1138
00:59:26,417 --> 00:59:28,625
Then, because I love to have a good time.

1139
00:59:29,167 --> 00:59:30,958
I don't like to cry.  I do

1140
00:59:31,042 --> 00:59:33,333
n't know if there are people who love it,

1141
00:59:33,417 --> 00:59:35,667
but I, without a doubt, love laughing.

1142
00:59:35,750 --> 00:59:38,875
I'm having a good time in life,
I'm very enjoyable.

1143
00:59:39,542 --> 00:59:44,292
Yes, sometimes I act stupid.

1144
00:59:45,083 --> 00:59:47,000
But, well, I think this is good and healthy.

1145
00:59:48,333 --> 00:59:49,583
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

1146
00:59:51,375 --> 00:59:52,583
Hello, Blanca, my name is Ali.

1147
00:59:52,667 --> 00:59:55,958
Well, this year I will start my
high school diploma in Performing Arts.

1148
00:59:56,042 --> 00:59:59,042
My question is:
What has been the most fun moment

1149
00:59:59,125 --> 01:00:01,917
