and what has been the worst?

1150
01:00:04,125 --> 01:00:07,250
The most fun thing on stage?

1151
01:00:07,333 --> 01:00:10,083
Well, I remember
one that was an anthology.

1152
01:00:11,833 --> 01:00:14,375
It's between funny and terrible.  We

1153
01:00:14,917 --> 01:00:17,708
were performing at the La Latina theater

1154
01:00:17,792 --> 01:00:21,125
a play by Jardiel Poncela
called “Mother: The Father's Drama”.

1155
01:00:21,625 --> 01:00:24,333
I played a mother who
had four daughters

1156
01:00:25,042 --> 01:00:27,750
