Then, on the wedding day...

1157
01:00:28,583 --> 01:00:31,167
It was a delirious comedy.

1158
01:00:32,417 --> 01:00:35,292
I am in great danger
because I laugh a lot.

1159
01:00:35,375 --> 01:00:37,708
When I laugh on stage, I can't stop.

1160
01:00:39,583 --> 01:00:43,375
There are actors
who keep their laughter inside and carry on.

1161
01:00:43,458 --> 01:00:46,417
You see their eyes flicker,
but they continue talking.

1162
01:00:46,833 --> 01:00:48,125
I am incapable of it.

1163
01:00:48,917 --> 01:00:51,125
Once I do “ha”, I
can't stop.

1164
01:00:51,833 --> 01:00:53,708
Once I've started, I continue.

1165
01:00:53,792 --> 01:00:56,625
Then, in comedies
I have to be super concentrated

1166
01:00:57,375 --> 01:01:00,208
because I pee laughing.
It's a big problem.

1167
01:01:00,292 --> 01:01:03,292
Plus, I also see my
colleague's work and it makes me laugh.

1168
01:01:03,375 --> 01:01:06,208
If he does it well,
then I laugh like a spectator.

1169
01:01:06,292 --> 01:01:07,208
Rich.

1170
01:01:07,292 --> 01:01:10,042
Well, I was super focused
and, in this scene,

1171
01:01:10,125 --> 01:01:14,708
the four brides discovered
that they were sisters of the four grooms

1172
01:01:14,792 --> 01:01:18,292
and a mess ensued, okay?

1173
01:01:18,875 --> 01:01:21,917
Then, there was a moment
when one of the actors

1174
01:01:22,000 --> 01:01:24,083
