1178
01:01:31,500 --> 01:01:33,167
He tripped and fell.

1179
01:01:33,625 --> 01:01:36,292
Like when you're walking down the street and someone falls...

1180
01:01:36,375 --> 01:01:37,667
It's terrible, we laugh.

1181
01:01:38,292 --> 01:01:39,583
It's terrible, isn't it?  I

1182
01:01:39,667 --> 01:01:42,833
don't know why we laugh,
but it's funny to see someone fall.

1183
01:01:42,917 --> 01:01:44,083
Will it be possible?

1184
01:01:44,750 --> 01:01:48,125
Well, there, on stage, even more so.  He
fell and then... It

1185
01:01:48,917 --> 01:01:52,208
was a laugh too, like dominoes
, bread, bread, bread, in a chain.

1186
01:01:52,292 --> 01:01:54,083
One, and the other, the other, the other...

1187
01:01:54,167 --> 01:01:57,583
I'm telling you that one of the girls,
who was wearing a wedding dress, was

1188
01:01:57,667 --> 01:02:01,417
