1189
01:02:02,833 --> 01:02:05,375
Literally, she was peeing.

1190
01:02:06,625 --> 01:02:07,917
He was pissing himself laughing.

1191
01:02:08,000 --> 01:02:11,958
A chain reaction
of “ha, ha, ha, ha, ha” ensued that was

1192
01:02:12,625 --> 01:02:14,375
