1193
01:02:14,458 --> 01:02:17,667
On the one hand, we were laughing our heads off
and happy, of course,

1194
01:02:17,750 --> 01:02:19,833
because laughter always brings you happiness,

1195
01:02:19,917 --> 01:02:23,375
and on the other hand, we were embarrassed...

1196
01:02:23,458 --> 01:02:26,125
At that moment,
I was sitting on the floor,

1197
01:02:26,208 --> 01:02:27,375
leaning on a table.

1198
01:02:27,792 --> 01:02:29,958
I kept getting under the table,

1199
01:02:30,583 --> 01:02:33,417
