1200
01:02:33,500 --> 01:02:37,625
to try to get it to stop,
because there was no way to stop it.

1201
01:02:37,708 --> 01:02:39,958
The more I tried to stop it, the worse it got.

1202
01:02:41,042 --> 01:02:45,042
Obviously, people noticed.

1203
01:02:45,458 --> 01:02:48,417
People aren't stupid and say:
"This isn't the function."  There was

1205
01:02:51,292 --> 01:02:54,000
because all the laughter on stage
spread down below.

1206
01:02:54,750 --> 01:02:57,792
We were
in that theater in La Latina for about five minutes,

1207
01:02:57,875 --> 01:03:01,792
everyone laughing: “Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha”.

1208
01:03:01,875 --> 01:03:02,958
Non-stop.

1209
01:03:03,042 --> 01:03:05,250
And we no longer knew where we were going.

1210
01:03:05,333 --> 01:03:08,042
That was chaos, but wonderful.

1211
01:03:08,708 --> 01:03:12,083
When things calmed down a bit,
I stood up and said:

1212
01:03:12,167 --> 01:03:15,583
"Forgive us, because it was...
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha. We

