Life has also shown me
that Ministers of Culture

1412
01:14:36,625 --> 01:14:39,167
almost never have anything to do
with culture.  They

1413
01:14:41,333 --> 01:14:44,167
may be people who are dedicated
to some sector of culture, I'm

1414
