not saying they aren't,

1415
01:14:45,667 --> 01:14:49,750
but the concept, the idea of culture and,
above all, a program,

1416
01:14:49,833 --> 01:14:55,000
an idea of what you want to achieve
when you want to do culture.  I have

1417
